Yosemite is an amazing place. It has mountains, valleys, lakes, rivers and the highest waterfalls in America. The
wildlife is amazing, too – most of all the huge trees. Some are 90 metres tall.
When people started cutting down the trees and damaging this beautiful place, the United States decided
to make Yosemite a National Park back in 1890. This has protected Yosemite since then, but people have
become a problem again. For over a century, more and more visitors have arrived each year. They love the
